          "Consolidate Latino voter base through authentic community engagement and responsive constituent services: 63.74% Hispanic population is the demographic majority and the sole constituency large enough to hold a 55-45 seat; genuine relationships with Latino civic organizations, cultural institutions, and community leadership matter more than messaging to broader California demographics.",
