          "Engage the 41.57% Latino plurality with specific constituency attention on immigrant family integration, Latinx small business support, and educational equity; in a multiethnic district this size, Latino voter consolidation is essential to a 68%-range margin, and visible neglect of Latino community concerns is the most direct path to margin erosion.",
          "Maintain credibility on public safety and school quality as prerequisites for renter confidence in urban governance; younger renters in Long Beach with children evaluate on whether neighborhoods are safe and schools are functional, and a representative who cannot demonstrate delivery on these basics loses authority with the moderate, materially focused base.",
          "Do not assume the 68% margin insulates against credible centrist or pragmatic conservative challenge: any opponent who can credibly argue that Lowenthal has become ideologically distant from renter economic concerns while maintaining the appearance of addressing them has a narrow path to competitive range in a district where 32% already votes Republican and renter economic anxiety is real and present."
