          "Lead on local service delivery, housing supply, and neighborhood stability: in a 62% Democratic district with a $127,544 median income and high homeownership, the swing constituency is affluent moderate voters who will abandon Democrats if schools decline, crime rises, or housing remains unaffordable while development is blocked.",
