          "Recognize that affluence masks vulnerability: $116,513 income does not mean economic security for Asian and Latino families navigating California's housing costs, education expenses, and healthcare systems; economic messaging that acknowledges this reality rather than assuming affluence equals satisfaction will resonate more effectively across the demographic majority."
